{"id":"metal","lemma":"metal","pos":"noun","rank":1913,"glosses":["metal"],"ipa":"/meˈtal/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"metales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-metal.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Esto está hecho de madera o de metal?","en":"Is it made of wood or metal?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589747","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"wood"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"El cobre y la plata son dos metales.","en":"Copper and silver are both metals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37953","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"copper"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"silver"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null]},{"text":"El plomo es un metal.","en":"Lead is a metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441848","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"lead"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom sumergió el metal caliente en agua fría.","en":"Tom plunged the hot metal into cold water.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803956","words":[null,{"g":"To submerge","l":"sumergir"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"hot, warm"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"beer"}]},{"text":"Me corté con una sierra para metales.","en":"I cut myself with a hacksaw.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515114","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to cut","l":"cortar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"saw"},{"g":"for"},null]}]}